build-dir/
# The output directory of build/libphp-build.sh (AGENTS.md "Commands"). A build
# overwrites it, so it must never be tracked; a tracked copy made every worktree
# dirty after every build and let a `git add -A` commit object files (#847).
/out/
*.log
php-fpm
php-fpm-*
# The packaged configuration and service files are sources, not build output;
# they only match the line above because they carry the binary's name.
!packaging/**
examples/http/certs/
__pycache__/
.run/
# Claude Code session state: worktrees, local MCP settings, transcripts.
.claude/
/findings.md
/review.md
/.env.worktree
